OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys caught riding e-scooters
OL,4,Athe wrong way on motorway slip road
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 12-year-old boys have been charged
OL,7,Fafter being caught riding e-scooters
OL,8,Fthe wrong way on a slip road of the M8
OL,9,Fmotorway.
OL,11,FPolice said the boys, who were wearing
OL,12,Fbalaclavas, were spotted by patrol
OL,13,Fofficers at the Hillington junction in
OL,14,FGlasgow on Tuesday.
OL,16,FOfficers stopped the pair, took them
OL,17,Fhome and charged them with road traffic
OL,18,Foffences. Both e-scooters were seized.
OL,20,FOne of the boys' parents was also
OL,21,Fcharged with offences under the Road
OL,22,FTraffic Act.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
